[31m-You can customize `options.rangeLimit` or set it to `Inifinity` to disable this altogether.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-**Examples**[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```js[m
[31m-// pattern exceeds the "rangeLimit", so it's optimized automatically[m
[31m-console.log(braces.expand('{1..1000}'));[m
