[31m-## Design principles[m
[31m-[m
[31m-- Fewer flags is better[m
[31m-- Works across all platforms[m
[31m-- Fewer features[m
[31m-- Let individuals build on top of nodemon[m
[31m-- Offer all CLI functionality as an API[m
[31m-- Contributions must have and pass tests[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Nodemon is not perfect, and CLI arguments has sprawled beyond where I'm completely happy, but perhaps it can be reduced a little one day.[m
