[31m-> Normalize slashes in a file path to be posix/unix-like forward slashes. Also condenses repeat slashes to a single slash and removes and trailing slashes, unless disabled.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Please consider following this project's author, [Jon Schlinkert](https://github.com/jonschlinkert), and consider starring the project to show your :heart: and support.[m
[31m-[m
[31m-## Install[m
[31m-[m
[31m-Install with [npm](https://www.npmjs.com/):[m
[31m-[m
[31m-```sh[m
