[31m-## Why picomatch?[m
[31m-[m
[31m-* **Lightweight** - No dependencies[m
[31m-* **Minimal** - Tiny API surface. Main export is a function that takes a glob pattern and returns a matcher function.[m
[31m-* **Fast** - Loads in about 2ms (that's several times faster than a [single frame of a HD movie](http://www.endmemo.com/sconvert/framespersecondframespermillisecond.php) at 60fps)[m
[31m-* **Performant** - Use the returned matcher function to speed up repeat matching (like when watching files)[m
[31m-* **Accurate matching** - Using wildcards (`*` and `?`), globstars (`**`) for nested directories, [advanced globbing](#advanced-globbing) with extglobs, braces, and POSIX brackets, and support for escaping special characters with `\` or quotes.[m
[31m-* **Well tested** - Thousands of unit tests[m
[31m-[m
[31m-See the [library comparison](#library-comparisons) to other libraries.[m
