[31m-<details>[m
[31m-<summary><strong>What does this do?</strong></summary>[m
[31m-[m
[31m-<br>[m
[31m-[m
[31m-This libary generates the `source` string to be passed to `new RegExp()` for matching a range of numbers.[m
